/ENTRY FOR DIVERTED HISPEED PUNCH OUTPUT
DWRITE,	0
	IOF		/INTER. OFF
	DCA ASCII	/SAVE CHAR
	ISZ DWRITE	/INCR. RET.ADDR.
	TAD MLINES	/2ND SCOPE PARAM
